  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "令人沉醉的柔软沙发",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/fu003",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=fu003",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"fu003\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "无论是在工作期间休息一下，或是和朋友相聚闲聊，这张舒适的沙发都能派上用场。柔软的软垫和靠垫助你尽情放松休息，或是舒服地坐在上面，和好友整夜畅聊。",
    "令人沉醉的柔软沙发"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3b0069693e5cf875/original/PH181123-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/fu003",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3b0069693e5cf875/original/PH181123-crop001.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "客厅里有两张ÄPPLARYD 艾普吕 沙发面对面放置着，沙发之间有一排茶几，上面放着一个杯子和笔记本电脑。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3b0069693e5cf875/original/PH181123-crop001.jpg",
